== a. the approval key the daemon serves
GRAIN_RELEASE_APPROVAL_KEY
Changing the deployment's signing key -- its -release-approval-kms-key, or its release-approval-key secret -- means updating GRAIN_RELEASE_APPROVAL_KEY to match in every repository that runs promote-release.yml.
